WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.468
Step five copies the run's folder,

2
00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:06.238
adds a row by hand to the copy's
C S V, and checks it again.

3
00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:11.076
The C S V no longer matches its
recorded hash; the jay-son still does.

4
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:14.562
That's how the manifest catches
a file changed after the run.

5
00:00:14.562 --> 00:00:18.524
Step six runs this chapter's
tests: eight pass, none fail.

6
00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:22.463
Step seven lists your runs,
one line per run, oldest first.

7
00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:25.993
There's nothing to clean up: the
kit's folder is as you unzipped it,

8
00:00:25.993 --> 00:00:28.440
and this run's results
stay in its own folder.
